# reject-mandate-widen — the delegate's mandate is not a subset of its
# delegator's (`procure` was never conferred); the mandate-attenuation
# invariant (§6) makes the graph ill-formed at apply.
actor boss mandate deploy
actor sub on-behalf-of boss mandate {deploy,procure}
gate g risk low grant boss[deploy:low] sub[deploy:low]
cord g -> master
